---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="SMS Consent & Messaging Terms | Oryele" description="Learn how Oryele manages SMS consent, transactional messaging, opt-out requests, and messaging compliance.">
<section class="hero"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Trust & compliance</p><h1>SMS Consent & Messaging Terms</h1><p>Oryele supports clear, auditable consent for service-related SMS communications.</p></div></section>
<section class="content"><div class="wrap grid">
  <div class="shot-card"><div class="browser"><span></span><span></span><span></span><b>Client portal consent experience</b></div><img src="/assets/sms-consent-portal.png" alt="Oryele client portal SMS consent screen showing express consent, messaging terms, and opt-out language" width="520" height="920" loading="eager"/></div>
  <div class="copy"><p class="eyebrow">Express consent</p><h2>Clear choices before a message is sent.</h2><p>Users are asked to affirmatively opt in before receiving SMS messages. Consent is optional and is recorded with the context required for governance and auditability.</p>
  <div class="points"><article><h3>Transactional communications</h3><p>Messages may include appointments, scheduling, document requests, workflow updates, account notifications, and other service-related communications.</p></article><article><h3>Opt-out controls</h3><p>Recipients may reply STOP to opt out and HELP for assistance. Consent can be withdrawn at any time.</p></article><article><h3>Audit-ready records</h3><p>Consent status, timestamps, and preference changes can be retained to support compliance reviews.</p></article></div>
  <div class="notice"><strong>Messaging notice</strong><p>Message frequency varies. Message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP to opt out and HELP for assistance. Consent is not a condition of purchase.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>
<section class="legal"><div class="wrap"><h2>Additional terms</h2><p>Oryele may deliver transactional SMS messages on behalf of business customers, including accounting firms, law firms, insurance agencies, and other professional organizations. End users receive messages only after providing express consent during onboarding or another documented consent process.</p><p>Oryele does not sell SMS consent information. Mobile information will not be shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes. Information may be shared with service providers solely as needed to deliver messaging services, maintain the platform, prevent fraud, and comply with law.</p><p><strong>Message and data rates may apply.</strong> Message frequency varies. Reply STOP to opt out or HELP for help.</p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.hero{padding-block:80px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#071528,#12366f);color:#fff}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(42px,6vw,72px);line-height:1.05;margin:0 0 18px}.hero p:not(.eyebrow){font-size:19px;color:#cad6e8;max-width:760px}.content,.legal{padding-block:clamp(64px,8vw,105px)}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(360px,.85fr) 1.15fr;gap:72px;align-items:start}.shot-card{background:#101217;border:1px solid #2a2e38;border-radius:22px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(7,21,40,.2)}.browser{height:48px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:0 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #2c3039;color:#a9b2c0;font-size:12px}.browser span{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#56606f}.browser b{margin-left:8px;font-weight:600}.shot-card img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}.copy h2,.legal h2{font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,50px);margin:0 0 20px}.copy>p:not(.eyebrow),.legal p{color:#3d4a61;line-height:1.75;font-size:16.5px}.points{display:grid;gap:14px;margin:30px 0}.points article{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:20px;background:#fff}.points h3{margin:0 0 7px;font-size:17px}.points p{margin:0;color:#4b5970;line-height:1.6}.notice{border-left:4px solid #1f5fd5;background:#eef5ff;padding:20px 22px;border-radius:0 12px 12px 0}.notice p{margin:7px 0 0;color:#263a59;line-height:1.65}.legal{background:#f5f8fc;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.legal .wrap{max-width:900px}.legal p{margin:0 0 16px}@media(max-width:900px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.shot-card{max-width:600px;margin:auto}}
</style>
